<v Host>To be swept away, to be carried off by the water.

00:04:53.947 --> 00:05:05.084
<v Slow>緊急のときは、ヘリコプターやドローンに付けた専用の受信機で、素早く場所を見つけられます。

00:05:05.884 --> 00:05:12.196
<v Host>In an emergency, a receiver on a helicopter or drone can locate the person quickly.

